Package: mighty.metadata
Title: CDISC ADaM Metadata Management in YAML Format
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ari", "Siggaard Knoph", , "aikp@novonordisk.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Esben", "Tore Moelgaard", , "ebtm@novonordisk.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Aksel", "Thomsen", , "oath@novonordisk.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Novo Nordisk A/S", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Tools for working with CDISC ADaM metadata in YAML format.
    This package provides functions for extracting metadata from standard
    sources, building structured ADaM metadata, generating YAML files, and
    HTML visualization.  It supports domain references tracking and
    maintains proper formatting for method fields in YAML output.
